<title>USA: Rhone Rorer's Taxotere getrs more clearances.</title>
<headline>Rhone Rorer's Taxotere getrs more clearances.</headline>
<dateline>COLLEGEVILLE, Pa. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rhone-Poulenc Rorer Inc said it has received marketing clearance for Taxotere to treat advanced or metastatic breast cancer in Switzerland, Chile, India, Tunisia and Cyprus.</p>
<p>Worldwide, Taxotere has now been cleared in 49 countries, the company said.  It said regulatory authorities in Chile and India have also cleared Taxotere for use in the treatment of advanced non-small-cell lung cancer.</p>
<p>Local affiliates in these countries are expected to launch Taxotere in the next few months, it said.</p>
</text>
